message: "If you use MelbourneMate, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "MelbourneMate"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: "MelbourneMate project team"
abstract: >-
  A test-driven retrieval-augmented generation system that helps international
  students find cited official information about settling in Melbourne and
  refuses questions that its approved knowledge base cannot support.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Elaine-tyl/MelbourneMate"
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - information retrieval
  - international students
  - Melbourne
  - question answering
